{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37743","headline":"转正郎後寄献集贤相公 · 郑谷","name":"转正郎後寄献集贤相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"予名初在德门前，屈指年来三十年。\n自贺孤危终际会，别将流涕感阶缘。\n止陪鸳鸯居清秩，滥应星辰浼上玄。\n平昔苦心何所恨，受恩多是旧诗篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37743.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37743","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}